366	    /**
367	     * Reports whether an owner should be flagged for review. The flag is true when any of three
368	     * independent signals hold and false only when none does: the owner is a possible (soft)
369	     * duplicate (its {@code possibleDuplicate} flag is set, see
370	     * {@link #applyPossibleDuplicate(Owner, OwnerFieldsDto)}), the owner's email domain is
371	     * disposable-adjacent (see {@link #isDisposableAdjacentEmail(String)}) or the owner's city is
372	     * over its soft capacity (see {@link #capacityWarning(String)}). This is the single definition
373	     * of an owner's risk flag, shared by every rendered response.
374	     *
375	     * @param owner the persisted owner to assess
376	     * @return {@code true} when any risk signal holds, otherwise {@code false}
377	     */
378	    private boolean riskFlag(Owner owner) {
