709	    /**
710	     * The number of owners a city must already contain before it is flagged as approaching its
711	     * capacity limit. Once a city holds at least this many owners (but is not yet at
712	     * {@link #CITY_OWNER_CAPACITY}), the create and read responses report {@code capacityWarning}
713	     * true for owners in that city.
714	     */
715	    private static final long CITY_CAPACITY_WARNING_THRESHOLD = 40L;
716	
717	    /**
718	     * Reports whether the given city is approaching its capacity limit, i.e. whether it already
719	     * contains between {@link #CITY_CAPACITY_WARNING_THRESHOLD} and {@link #CITY_OWNER_CAPACITY}
