734	    /**
735	     * Builds the unified {@code memberId} assigned to a newly created owner. The id is formatted as
736	     * {@code '<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>'}, concatenating (with no separators) the owner's region code
737	     * (see {@link Owner#getRegionCode()}, rendered {@code 'UNKNOWN'} when the owner has no known
738	     * region), the two-digit fiscal-year segment its business-day-adjusted {@code registrationDate}
739	     * falls in (see {@link Owner#fiscalYearSegment(LocalDate)}), its identity hash (see
740	     * {@link Owner#getIdentityHash()}, the first 8 upper-case hex characters of the SHA-256 digest
741	     * over the owner's normalized E.164 {@code telephone} concatenated with its {@code lastName}) and
742	     * a single Luhn check digit (see {@link Owner#luhnCheckDigit(String)}) computed over the digits of
743	     * {@code <REGION><FY><HASH8>}. The composed base is then de-duplicated against existing owners
744	     * (see {@link #deduplicateMemberId(String)}). The base carries no sequence number, so two owners
745	     * sharing a region, fiscal year, telephone and last name resolve to the same base and are
746	     * separated only by de-duplication.
747	     *
748	     * @param owner the owner being created, whose fields the id is derived from
749	     * @return the formatted member id
750	     */
751	    private String memberIdFor(Owner owner) {
752	        String prefix = owner.getRegionCode()
753	            + Owner.fiscalYearSegment(owner.getRegistrationDate())
754	            + owner.getIdentityHash();
755	        return deduplicateMemberId(prefix + Owner.luhnCheckDigit(prefix));
756	    }
