1167	     * result includes the newly persisted owner. An owner without a household (a {@code null}
1168	     * identifier) belongs to no shared household, so an empty list is returned. This is the single
1169	     * definition of a household's members, shared by every rule that reasons about the owners
1170	     * sharing a household (the household-duplicate block and the household member count).
1171	     *
1172	     * @param householdId the shared household identifier, or {@code null} when the owner shares no household
1173	     * @return the owners in the household, or an empty list when {@code householdId} is {@code null}
1174	     */
1175	    private List<Owner> householdMembers(String householdId) {
1176	        if (householdId == null) {
1177	            return List.of();
